    <briefdescription>
<para>Lightweight counter attached to a <computeroutput><ref refid="class_concrete_vector_arithmetic" kindref="compound">ConcreteVectorArithmetic</ref>&lt;<ref refid="class_ring" kindref="compound">Ring</ref>&gt;</computeroutput> for tracking how many coefficient additions a reduction performed. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <computeroutput><ref refid="class_vector_arithmetic_stats_a503dec8bdd70431022f762098f5c1aa2_1a503dec8bdd70431022f762098f5c1aa2" kindref="member">mNumAdditions</ref></computeroutput> counter is <computeroutput>mutable</computeroutput> so that it can be incremented from within <computeroutput>const</computeroutput> arithmetic methods. <computeroutput><ref refid="class_vector_arithmetic_stats_a5d0444d9756ec843543f39b07c1bf7c4_1a5d0444d9756ec843543f39b07c1bf7c4" kindref="member">numAdditions()</ref></computeroutput> reports the running total. Plugged into the F4 / GB code paths via <computeroutput>VectorArithmetic::numAdditions()</computeroutput> for profiling. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
